    "text": "By Gillian Brooks ,\n5 hours ago BIRMINGHAM, Ala. (WBRC) - More people are living in downtown Birmingham, according to a new report from REV Birmingham showing the apartment occupancy rate reaching 84%. Two major apartment buildings opened at the end of 2025, adding more than 500 new units in downtown Birmingham. Jackson Dean, research and data... Read full article\n2",
